{#-
  Typed read-only views over SpanRecord (ADR D8), one per span type that has a starter, generated
  from the same rows: `{Group}Span` structs and the `spans.{Group}()` selectors on
  SpanViews / IncubatingSpanViews.

  A view exposes only what the collector persists (the policy's persistence rule, the same one
  RegistryPolicy carries), so a test can never assert a key ingest drops; the session spine
  (session.id, gen_ai.conversation.id) is lifted into a column and is read through the trace,
  never as an attribute. Template, deprecated and group-fixed attributes get no property. A view
  of a database span carries its StoreIdentity. A span matches a view when its kind is the group's,
  every persisted required attribute is present and every fixed attribute has the group's value.
-#}
